        "q1":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"How much energy does the 314Ah battery store?","answer":"<p>The rated energy is 4,019.2Wh from the documented 12.8V and 314Ah ratings. Actual usable energy depends on operating limits, load and system settings.</p>"}},
